<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">NJU campus mutual aid</view>
      <view class="title">NanE 南易</view>
      <view class="subtitle">把宿舍里用不完的应急耗材，交给正需要的人。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="badge">{{viewer.building || '南苑 A 栋'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="search panel">
    <input value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onKeywordInput" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="onSearch" placeholder="搜索退烧贴、碘伏、创可贴" />
    <button bindtap="onSearch">搜索</button>
  </view>

  <scroll-view scroll-x class="chips">
    <view
      wx:for="{{categories}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      class="chip {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}"
      data-category="{{item}}"
      bindtap="chooseCategory"
    >{{item}}</view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="notice panel">
    NanE 仅做校园互助信息撮合。所有物品免费共享，禁止处方药、管控药和任何形式的收费转让，发布内容需人工审核。
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <text>附近互助</text>
    <text class="hint">同楼栋优先排序</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty panel">正在连接 NanE API...</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{errorMessage}}" class="empty panel">
    <view>{{errorMessage}}</view>
    <button class="retry" bindtap="loadItems">重试</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{items.length === 0}}" class="empty panel">暂时没有符合条件的物品</view>

  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="item panel" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openDetail">
    <view class="item-main">
      <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="item-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
      <view class="meta">
        <text>{{item.category}}</text>
        <text>{{item.campus}} · {{item.building}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="item-side">
      <view class="scope {{item.distanceScope}}">{{item.distanceLabel}}</view>
      <view class="qty">{{item.quantity}}{{item.unit}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
